{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Not El</b> — who can bear anger [i.e., mortal wrath]. Moreover: <b>for in your midst</b> — within you alone I was holy." "<b>For El am I and not a man, and I will not come in a city</b> — after the manner of: \"Elohim settled the man\" [i.e., a divine idiom for human dwelling]. And the Gaon [Saadia] said: I will not come in any other city but in Jerusalem alone."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:56.179744061Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}